= Magnus Harnfell

Magnus Harnfell is the founder of the Institute of Sexual Science and an advocate for the rights of sexual minorities. [? if homosexual_rights: He currently has considerable support among party factions due to the <span style="color: #c00000;">**Marchers**</span>'s achievement in homosexual rights. ?]


- @homosexual_rights_
- @womens_rights_
- @magi_advocacy: Advocacy for the magi.
- @science_funding
- @root: Return to main


@homosexual_rights_
title: Homosexual rights
subtitle: Enact policy that supports homosexual rights.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0 and marcher_in_government and progressive_coalition >= 50 and not concord_women_accepted
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?][? if not marcher_in_government : The <span style="color: #c00000;">Marchers</span> is not currently in government. ?][? if progressive_coalition < 50 : We do not have the votes to enact these policies. ?] [? if concord_women_accepted : Our coalition agreement stipulates against action toward Homosexual rights. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; homosexual_rights_timer -= 11; last_advisor_action = 1
go-to: homosexual_rights


@womens_rights_
title: Women's rights
subtitle: Enact policy with regards to women's rights.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0 and marcher_in_government and not concord_women_accepted
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?][? if not marcher_in_government : The <span style="color: #c00000;">Marchers</span> is not currently in government. ?] [? if concord_women_accepted : Our coalition agreement stipulates against action toward Women's rights. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; womens_rights_timer -= 10; last_advisor_action = 1
