@science_funding
title: Science funding
subtitle: Increase funding for scientific research.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0 and marcher_in_government and economic_minister_party = "Marcher" and chancellor_party = "Marcher"
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?][? if not marcher_in_government : The <span style="color: #c00000;">Marchers</span> is not currently in government. ?][? if economic_minister_party != "Marcher": This requires the Economic Ministry. ?][? if chancellor_party != "Marcher": The Chancellor must be an <span style="color: #c00000;">Marchers</span> member. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; last_advisor_action = 1
go-to: education_science.increase_science


@magi_advocacy
title: Advocacy for the magi
subtitle: Harnfell lends his institute's standing to the magi circles' cause.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; magi_balance += 4 if magi_balance < 100; last_advisor_action = 1

Harnfell turns his pamphleteers and his podium to the magi's cause — lectures in the guild halls, careful essays in the respectable press, a public correspondence with sympathetic jurists. It is slow work against old fear, but the ground shifts a little wherever he speaks.
